4 0 obj
<<
  /Parent 3 0 R
  /Next 5 0 R
  /Title (1.1 To build real-world applications, using "vanilla" PHP is rarely efficient, especially for complex projects. We tend to prefer using PHP frameworks. A framework provides a structured foundation and reusable components that speed up development. Moreover, frameworks help us to write code that is more secure and easier to maintain.)
  /Dest 417 0 R
>>
endobj

5 0 obj
<<
  /Parent 3 0 R
  /Next 6 0 R
  /Prev 4 0 R
  /Title (1.2 There are many PHP frameworks, as today, the most popular are Symfony and Laravel. In this training project, you will have the opportunity to choose the framework you want to learn : Symfony or Laravel. But remember that the goal is to learn how to use a PHP framework. One day you will have to be able to adapt to other frameworks as well.)
  /Dest 418 0 R
>>
endobj

